# Shell scripts are executed, not just read: a CRLF checkout fails on the first
# line ("set: command not found") under Git Bash. Keep them LF everywhere.
*.sh text eol=lf

# The web client and the server are plain JS run by node; LF keeps diffs honest
# across the two machines this is developed on.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
